<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bristol-Myers upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bristol-Myers upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Bristol-Myers Squibb Co to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said it kept Bristol-Myers at long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Bristol-Myers gained 3 to 126-1/8.</p>
<p>-- additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
